# ERD FINTRACK — Mermaid

> Render otomatis di GitHub. Export PNG: salin blok kode ke https://mermaid.live → Actions → PNG/SVG.

```mermaid
erDiagram
    USERS ||--o{ CATEGORIES : "memiliki"
    USERS ||--o{ FINANCIAL_TODOS : "memiliki"
    USERS ||--o{ TRANSACTIONS : "memiliki"
    USERS ||--o{ BUDGETS : "memiliki"
    CATEGORIES ||--o{ TRANSACTIONS : "digunakan"
    CATEGORIES ||--o{ BUDGETS : "dipakai"
    FINANCIAL_TODOS |o--o| TRANSACTIONS : "auto expense"

    USERS {
        char_36 id PK
        varchar_100 name
        varchar_255 email UK
        varchar_255 password_hash
        datetime created_at
        datetime updated_at
    }

    CATEGORIES {
        char_36 id PK
        char_36 user_id FK
        varchar_100 name
        transaction_type type
        datetime created_at
        datetime updated_at
    }

    FINANCIAL_TODOS {
        char_36 id PK
        char_36 user_id FK
        varchar_200 title
        decimal_15_2 amount
        date due_date
        tinyint_1 is_completed
        tinyint_1 auto_expense
        datetime created_at
        datetime updated_at
    }

    TRANSACTIONS {
        char_36 id PK
        char_36 user_id FK
        char_36 category_id FK
        char_36 source_todo_id FK_UK
        transaction_type type
        decimal_15_2 amount
        date date
        text notes
        datetime created_at
        datetime updated_at
    }

    BUDGETS {
        char_36 id PK
        char_36 user_id FK
        char_36 category_id FK
        decimal_15_2 amount_limit
        date month_year
        datetime created_at
        datetime updated_at
    }
```

## Catatan Relasi

| Relasi | Kardinalitas | Keterangan |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| users → categories | 1 : N | `ON DELETE CASCADE` |
| users → financial_todos | 1 : N | `ON DELETE CASCADE` |
| users → transactions | 1 : N | `ON DELETE CASCADE` |
| users → budgets | 1 : N | `ON DELETE CASCADE` |
| categories → transactions | 1 : N | `ON DELETE RESTRICT` (BR-DATA-03) |
| categories → budgets | 1 : N | `ON DELETE RESTRICT` |
| financial_todos → transactions | 1 : 0..1 | via `source_todo_id` + unique (BR-AUTO-03) |
